1
00:00:00,111 --> 00:00:01,901
- Hear, hear!
Hear, hear!

2
00:00:02,613 --> 00:00:05,073
(Raj:)Okay, uh, anybody else? Huh?

3
00:00:05,241 --> 00:00:07,411
(Raj:)No? Okay.

4
00:00:07,576 --> 00:00:11,876
It all comes down to me as the best man.
Ha-ha-ha.

5
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:16,420
Ooh, this grasshopper
is kicking my ass-hopper. Ha-ha-ha.

6
00:00:17,211 --> 00:00:22,301
(Raj:)Okay, when I first came to this country,
l didn't know how to behave...

7
00:00:22,466 --> 00:00:25,056
(Raj:)...or how to dress, or what was cool.

8
00:00:25,219 --> 00:00:30,639
l was pretty lonely. But then I met Howard,
and suddenly my life changed...

9
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:33,770
(Raj:)...because we could be lonely together.

10
00:00:37,481 --> 00:00:39,901
(Raj:)This man became my whole world.

11
00:00:41,485 --> 00:00:44,275
Yeah. Nice speech, Francine.

12
00:00:47,491 --> 00:00:50,331
(Raj:)I'm not done, but thank you.

13
00:00:50,828 --> 00:00:52,908
l think back...

14
00:00:55,624 --> 00:00:58,754
(Raj:)...to all the good times we had,
like, uh, when we went camping...

15
00:00:58,919 --> 00:01:02,019
(Raj:)...and spent that night
telling each other all our secrets.

